荷は確実な死\n深界極点 : 奈落の底\n  詳細不明。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-gadget","ts":1613911152.247800,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1613911152247800","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C016J5KFARM/p1613911152247800"}],"subtype":"slackbot_response","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":4,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U776661HA","U023H98P3N0","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"D667661C-3CB6-44A7-B53E-09101C55D0C9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"!メイドインガジェット","ts":"1631002811.260900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"51n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c126ebd-79f4-4dd6-82ab-5dc80ba9cb9b","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"なんか散歩してたら財布が軽くなってRasberry Pi 4 が部屋に置いてあった","ts":"1631000697.258700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"spin_keizai","count":10,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U013QL1RAPN","U81LLJ340","UD1FQV38V","U06BRP8VD","UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW","U023040U953","U01G8EQMVUL","U0230SSJ32B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WDGX"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1631000632.257500","files":[{"id":"F02DGTG0DQV","created":1631000621,"timestamp":1631000621,"name":"1D5A97FA-DDF2-4BE2-98FA-349DA44FD0A7_1_105_c.jpeg","title":"1D5A97FA-DDF2-4BE2-98FA-349DA44FD0A7_1_105_c.jpeg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U782D5DF1","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":303071,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02DGTG0DQV/1d5a97fa-ddf2-4be2-98fa-349da44fd0a7_1_105_c.jpeg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02DGTG0DQV/download/1d5a97fa-ddf2-4be2-98fa-349da44fd0a7_1_105_c.jpeg","original_h":768,"original_w":1024,"thumb_64":"https://fi